5189_4915271146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xyYk_BGIR4sQ7kNvwFrhLf6&_nc_oc=AdpZqgopphzoveOB1ZeQyQnDsk08iJh9wcEGMVJUTVcWOY_3dGB3QRM2zOj2763sNrk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFTTQnORyWfkgQJagaU95zYCZCYZcuJitp5N9YzuCpFNw&oe=6A85AB39"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hBnbs3g3sisQ7kNvwEqzaeU&_nc_oc=AdoHVA5GVv_B6G63iaN0nO1ox-mJLJZxDSvgfkGtf6Z89Ytahh5ZTTPziaicDZNFCYE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEc7hhCCcdKp-NylJNv2jBmTHyRCKQKnrtPljicnTXW1w&oe=6A8585D3"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9GfKGaRWCJQQ7kNvwGLnb3Z&_nc_oc=Adq5AjIfo2HGMrY_1DtgGgF5LnVy5dbLUK-q1h1FMqNnBsxlitKvzf3r1knpq-W9USs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEbuC0LOoRjhjw0z5raTfVUJg8ty8VHSX9oLOXK2_44kA&oe=6A85841A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy